Counts describe this supplied share of posts from the previously tagged random sample, not people or prevalence in the market. All 191 supplied posts were read in full; none remains unread. Each post has one main form; tags overlap. The two Other posts retain their fictional or professional provenance.

Tags count explicit reported actions or preparation, advice or actions by other people, completed purchases or payments, and named feelings of the speaker. A child’s behaviour alone, future plans and merely owning or using an item do not establish an attempt or purchase. Feelings about the child are kept distinct from feelings attributed only to the child. The bought total includes one explicitly satirical post (14 other posts report purchases); the per-post yes/no coding for both sections is retained in the comment at the end.

### What they tried, in their words

- "We’ve tried just about everything: reward-based/incentivized training, and taking him to the bathroom on a schedule (every 20, 30, 60, even 90 minutes)." [ar012-0002]
- "We’ve tried being naked, encouragement, different types of potties and toilet attachments, full on bribes like chocolate or a new dress, sticker charts, making the bathroom exciting by adding string lights and books, bubbles" [ar071-0010]
- "We've tried: scheduled prompting, game framing, first/then sequencing, autonomy-based approaches, rewards, dropping the rope, narrating our own process." [ar080-0033]
- "Bubbles, water play, books, drawing while on toilet, stickers, running the tap, even screen time because we were desperate." [ar002-0085]
- "So today I put pull ups on and said he could poop in there if needed but pee still goes in the potty." [ar015-0018]
- "For us, it was a "clean out" day of mirolax and exlax." [ar037-0105]
- "We then switched to wearing pull-ups and sitting on the potty every 30 mins this worked way better for all of us." [ar057-0104]
- "I offered him the diaper but reminded him, if he poops there poop doesn’t get to go party. He decided to sit on the potty and proceeded to poop with no diaper." [ar055-0112]
