### They need toilet learning to work before a school deadline or an exclusion.

12 of 179 posts.

Parents of children aged two and a half through three and a half describe school entry, access to affordable care or continued attendance depending on toilet independence. Requirements can include self-initiation, clothing and wiping, while children still refuse, hold urine or need prompts. Some have weeks or a few months left and feel unable simply to wait for readiness.

- "We are both in tears because he doesn't want to and I need him to. I need him to go to jk in the fall and I am freaking out because im afraid he wont be able to be potty trained in time." [ar083-0074]
