### They can get potty success while their child is naked but lose it when clothes go on.

5 of 179 posts.

Parents of two-year-olds and one three-year-old describe reliable naked potty use followed by wetting or soiling in underwear or trousers. Some think clothing feels like a diaper; others are unsure whether pulling clothing down is the obstacle. Demonstrations, loose shorts, practice and partial help have not bridged the gap.

- "It has been great and she is both pooping and peeing in it all on her own when she is naked from the waist down. Unfortunately, once the underwear is on she goes back to treating it like the diaper." [ar073-0083]
