- "He will swat or push on his privates in the groin area when he really gets the urge to poop in an effort to distract his body." [ar032-0061]

**But:** The obstacle is not always unwillingness to sit or an absence of awareness. "He will tell me when he feels poop coming & he’s happy to sit, but very little to no action." [ar026-0040]

