- "The biggest issue is that when he’s playing, he gets so locked in that he refuses to stop—he’d rather go in his pull-up or underwear than take a break to use the toilet." [ar012-0002]

**But:** Lack of advance notice can coexist with substantial toilet success. "He’s peeing in the toilet about 70% of the time." [ar038-0158]

